From 93a80a36f9b826f168feecae04e9d8a8c89acba9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tanmay Varun <varuntanmay21@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 10:12:16 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] fix(agent): SEARCH EffectStatus UNKNOWN after AX-blind
 locate

Classify ok+!found as UNKNOWN only when the observation substrate is
blind; trustworthy negatives and exhausted search are NOT_ACHIEVED.
Arm pending_effect_verification for UNKNOWN; still_unobservable keeps
MethodStatus UNTRIED while currently_ineligible; MethodFrontier picks
the next locate realization.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
